---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const effectiveDate = 'August 4, 2026';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '/privacy' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Everstead Roofing Co collects, uses, and protects your information."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <section class="policy-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="policy-hero__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="policy-hero__date">Effective date: {effectiveDate}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section policy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="policy__body">
        <p class="policy__lead">
          This policy explains what information Everstead Roofing Co collects, why we collect it,
          and what we do with it.
        </p>

        <p>
          Everstead Roofing Co is a registered trade name of <strong>BTN Homes LLC</strong>, a
          Washington limited liability company.
        </p>

        <ul class="policy__contact-list">
          <li>4200 SE Columbia Way, Suite F, Vancouver, WA 98661</li>
          <li><a href="tel:+13603429525">(360) 342-9525</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:hello@eversteadroofing.com">hello@eversteadroofing.com</a></li>
          <li>Washington Contractor Registration # BTNHOHL796B9</li>
        </ul>

        <hr class="policy__rule" />

        <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>

        <p>
          <strong>Information you give us directly.</strong> When you request a quote — through our
          website, a Facebook or Instagram lead form, a door hanger QR code, a phone call, or a text
          — we may collect:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Your name</li>
          <li>Your phone number and email address</li>
          <li>The street address of the property you want serviced</li>
          <li>Details about the work you're requesting</li>
          <li>Photos or measurements you send us</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          <strong>Information we collect automatically.</strong> When you visit our website we may
          collect your IP address, browser and device type, pages viewed, and the site or ad that
          referred you.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Property information.</strong> To prepare a quote, we may look up publicly
          available information about the property address you give us, including aerial and
          satellite imagery and county assessor records.
        </p>

        <h2>2. How we collect it</h2>

        <p>
          We collect information directly from you, from our website, from lead forms hosted on Meta
          platforms (Facebook and Instagram), and through cookies and similar tracking technologies
          described in Section 5.
        </p>

        <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>

        <p>We use your information to:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Prepare and send you a quote</li>
          <li>Contact you about your request, by phone, text, or email</li>
          <li>Schedule, perform, and service the work you hire us for</li>
          <li>Send you renewal offers for services you have previously purchased</li>
          <li>Process payments</li>
          <li>Keep records required for warranty, licensing, tax, and insurance purposes</li>
          <li>Improve our website and advertising</li>
        </ul>

        <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information.</p>

        <h2>4. Text messages and phone calls</h2>

        <p>
          If you provide your phone number and agree to be contacted, we may call or text you about
          your quote, your scheduled work, and seasonal service renewals.
        </p>

        <p>
          Message and data rates may apply. Message frequency varies.
          <strong>Consent to receive marketing texts is not a condition of purchase.</strong>
        </p>

        <p>
          To stop receiving texts, reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message. To get help, reply
          <strong>HELP</strong>. You may also call or email us using the contact details above.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Cookies and tracking technologies</h2>

        <p>
          Our website uses cookies and similar technologies, including the <strong>Meta Pixel</strong>,
          to understand how visitors use our site and to measure and improve our advertising.
        </p>

        <p>
          These tools may allow Meta to recognize your browser or device and to show you our ads on
          Facebook and Instagram. You can control cookies through your browser settings, and you can
          manage ad personalization in your Facebook and Instagram account settings.
        </p>

        <h2>6. When we share information</h2>

        <p>We share information only as follows:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Service providers</strong> who help us operate — for example scheduling and
            customer management software, payment processors, and text and email delivery services.
            They may use your information only to provide services to us.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Advertising platforms</strong>, in aggregate or hashed form, to measure ad
            performance.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Subcontractors</strong> we assign to perform work at your property, limited to
            what they need to do the job.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>When required by law</strong>, including in response to a valid legal request, or
            to protect our rights, safety, or property.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties.</p>

        <h2>7. How long we keep it</h2>

        <p>
          We keep quote requests and customer records for as long as needed to serve you and to meet
          our legal, tax, warranty, and insurance obligations. Because our service is seasonal and
          renews annually, we retain customer records between seasons so we can reinstall your lights
          without re-measuring.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you ask us to delete your information, we will do so unless we are required to keep it by
          law.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Security</h2>

        <p>
          We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards to protect your information. No
          method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute
          security.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Your choices</h2>

        <p>You may:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Ask what personal information we hold about you</li>
          <li>Ask us to correct it</li>
          <li>Ask us to delete it</li>
          <li>Opt out of marketing texts (reply STOP) or emails (use the unsubscribe link)</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          To make a request, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@eversteadroofing.com">hello@eversteadroofing.com</a> or
          <a href="tel:+13603429525">(360) 342-9525</a>. We may need to verify your identity before
          responding.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Children</h2>

        <p>
          Our services are directed to adult property owners. We do not knowingly collect personal
          information from children under 13.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Changes to this policy</h2>

        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the effective date
          at the top of this page.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Contact us</h2>

        <address class="policy__address">
          <strong>Everstead Roofing Co</strong> (BTN Homes LLC)<br />
          4200 SE Columbia Way, Suite F<br />
          Vancouver, WA 98661<br />
          <a href="tel:+13603429525">(360) 342-9525</a><br />
          <a href="mailto:hello@eversteadroofing.com">hello@eversteadroofing.com</a>
        </address>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy-hero {
    background: var(--color-navy);
    color: var(--color-white);
    padding: calc(var(--space-16, 4rem) + 60px) 0 var(--space-12, 3rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .policy-hero__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .policy-hero__date {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .policy__body {
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .policy__lead {
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .policy__body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin: var(--space-10, 2.5rem) 0 var(--space-3);
    line-height: 1.3;
    scroll-margin-top: 100px;
  }

  .policy__body p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .policy__body ul {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .policy__body li {
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .policy__body li::marker {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .policy__body a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .policy__body a:hover {
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .policy__body strong {
    color: var(--color-navy);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .policy__contact-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    background: var(--color-cream);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-primary);
  }

  .policy__rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(21, 37, 54, 0.12);
    margin: var(--space-10, 2.5rem) 0;
  }

  .policy__address {
    font-style: normal;
    padding: var(--space-6);
    background: var(--color-cream);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .policy__body {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .policy__contact-list,
    .policy__address {
      padding: var(--space-4);
    }
  }
</style>
